            "review_title": "Review at The Pit Smoker Restraurant",
            "review_text": "Flora\nAmsterdam, The Netherlands2 contributions\n0\nBBQ TEXAS\nSep 2026 • Solo\nAbsolutely loved the food here! The beef ribs were incredible — so tender, juicy, and full of flavor. Honestly, they can easily compete with some of the best ribs I’ve had in other places.\n\nThe brisket was another highlight. It was seriously juicy and had its own unique character and flavor that made it stand out. Everything felt well-smoked and thoughtfully prepared.\n\nSince I was heading back home after a three-week trip, I couldn’t leave without getting one last portion to enjoy before my flight. If I ever come back, this will definitely be one of the places I return to.\n\nHighly recommended! 🔥🥩\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
