            "review_title": "Review at The Pit Smoker Restraurant",
            "review_text": "7keyvank\nOslo, Norway6 contributions\n0\nAmazing BBQ Experience\nJul 2026 • Family\nFantastic experience at The Pitsmoker! The food was absolutely delicious, with perfectly cooked and flavorful meat. Everything tasted fresh and you can really tell that they put a lot of care into the food.\nThe staff were incredibly friendly, welcoming and attentive, which made the whole experience even better. Great atmosphere, generous portions and excellent quality.\nDefinitely one of our best food experiences in Ho Chi Minh City. Highly recommended, especially if you love good BBQ and smoked meat. We will definitely come back!\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2026",
