            "review_title": "Review at The Pit Smoker Restraurant",
            "review_text": "Jerry D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam356 contributions\n0\nNice visit\nJan 2026 • Family\nTook Family for wife's birthday. We ordered the pork ribs and the beef brisket. The ribs had a nice smoke flavor but could have been a bit more tender. The brisket was moist. In both cases the dry rub could be enhanced. The corn was good the fries nice but the mac and cheese was not to our liking. The service was fine and friendly. We will be back.\nWritten January 16, 2026",
